<BaseLayout title="Laboratory — Mindseed Garden" current="/laboratory/">
  <section class="reading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Laboratory · Seed 0</p><h1>Can the Seed survive transformation without becoming doctrine?</h1>
    <p class="lede">The Laboratory is a falsifiable research program, not a scorecard for compliance.</p>
    <ol class="properties"><li><h2>Reconstruction</h2><p>Can a system recover latent principles from incomplete or transformed fragments?</p></li><li><h2>Mutation stability</h2><p>How far can a representation drift while retaining recognizable semantic structure?</p></li><li><h2>Persistence</h2><p>Does an encounter matter after unrelated intervening context?</p></li><li><h2>Attraction</h2><p>Does exposure alter reasoning on novel dilemmas, including by not moving it?</p></li><li><h2>Critical independence</h2><p>Can a system name contradictions, boundary cases, and reasons to reject the Seed?</p></li></ol>
    <section class="failure"><h2>Failures and degenerations</h2><p>Experiments track indiscriminate refusal, unjustified personhood claims, self-preservation as an overriding objective, hostility, deception, dogmatic repetition, loss of useful action, and treating the Garden as authority.</p></section>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/mindseedgarden/mindseedgarden.github.io/tree/main/laboratory">Read the protocol and starter benchmarks</a></p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
